00:04:16.600 --> 00:04:21.120
You're looking at $6,400 a month. And

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:23.360
this is where the packages come in.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:26.480
Every time a parent upgrades to the foam

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:28.320
